{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ofy9wn61","slide":3,"text":"The palette is intentionally small: canvas and ink carry most of the UI; violet is the signal of movement.\nUse #7C60F6 as the brand anchor, #4B1FD1 for high-contrast actions and #A896FF for soft emphasis.\nThe gradient values are implementation-ready starting tokens, but should be sampled and approved against the final vector logo.\nDo not use purple for every state. Success, warning and danger remain semantic and must stay distinguishable."}
